<title>UK: Eksportfinans sets 100 million Sfr seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>Eksportfinans sets 100 million Sfr seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Union Bank of Switzerland.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EKSPORTFINANS</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN SFR   COUPON     4.0 PCT   MATURITY    10.OCT.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.375   PAY DATE    10.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  STANDARD  REOFFER    =	   EOS	   20.SEP.96</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS US/NO</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
